00:11:31.487 --> 00:11:32.637
"I'm a freaking loner!"

00:11:34.010 --> 00:11:37.600
But anyways, he texted me.

00:11:37.600 --> 00:11:38.990
It was my first time sneaking out,

00:11:38.990 --> 00:11:40.187
again, I thought, "Super exciting.

00:11:40.187 --> 00:11:42.657
"Oh my gosh, I'm 13, I'm
seeking out to see a boy.

00:11:42.657 --> 00:11:44.244
"So exciting."

00:11:44.244 --> 00:11:46.710
I climbed out, we were in a,

00:11:46.710 --> 00:11:48.110
our home there was really big.

00:11:48.110 --> 00:11:50.280
We had many acres and it was,

00:11:50.280 --> 00:11:53.070
I had to climb out, go into
logs, get out and everything.

00:11:53.070 --> 00:11:55.500
I ended up meeting him in his car.

00:11:55.500 --> 00:12:00.130
We drove, he said he wanted
to go to an abandoned church

00:12:00.130 --> 00:12:02.280
where him and his
friends went to drink at.

00:12:02.280 --> 00:12:04.080
And at that point I had been,

00:12:04.080 --> 00:12:06.480
I'd been drinking for a
while, for about a year.

00:12:08.200 --> 00:12:11.840
But it wasn't bad.

00:12:11.840 --> 00:12:14.240
I was drinking, but I wasn't, you know,

00:12:14.240 --> 00:12:15.073
I was functioning.

00:12:15.073 --> 00:12:16.560
I was fine.

00:12:16.560 --> 00:12:20.837
He ended up, we ended
up going to the church,

00:12:20.837 --> 00:12:23.940
parking outside and he gave me a drink.

00:12:23.940 --> 00:12:28.480
The drink was your
roofied, but I didn't know.

00:12:28.480 --> 00:12:30.380
It was just, I thought it was alcohol.

00:12:31.690 --> 00:12:33.320
So we went into the church

00:12:33.320 --> 00:12:38.320
and I started feeling wrong, right away,

00:12:38.320 --> 00:12:41.700
just off and unsafe.

00:12:41.700 --> 00:12:44.640
I remember feeling very,
just like uncomfortable,

00:12:44.640 --> 00:12:45.600
just like I wanna be home.

00:12:45.600 --> 00:12:47.880
