I don't know where I am.

00:12:50.270 --> 00:12:51.160
Very weird feeling.

00:12:51.160 --> 00:12:55.203
Never felt that, just
uncomfortable weirdness.

00:12:56.720 --> 00:13:01.720
And then he raped me at the church.

00:13:02.270 --> 00:13:03.593
I remember parts of it.

00:13:05.950 --> 00:13:07.683
And I remember him,

00:13:10.140 --> 00:13:14.820
sorry, dropping me back at my house,

00:13:14.820 --> 00:13:19.820
