just took everything away.

00:13:54.010 --> 00:13:56.820
When I first took Xanax,

00:13:56.820 --> 00:13:58.850
I can't even tell you who it was.

00:13:58.850 --> 00:14:00.010
That's why it's my drug of choice.

00:14:00.010 --> 00:14:01.650
