good because it takes my,

00:14:06.620 --> 00:14:08.190
even when I'm off of it, you know,

00:14:08.190 --> 00:14:10.290
it affects my memory, my long-term memory.

00:14:11.160 --> 00:14:13.210
When I'm on it, it's the best feeling

00:14:13.210 --> 00:14:16.130
